  "description": "Apartamento T1 duplex, renovado, com 95 m2 de área bruta privativa, inserido no prestigiado condomínio Victory Village, com estacionamento privado, piscina e jardim, na Quinta do Lago, Algarve. \n\nO apartamento, que é vendido completamente mobilado e equipado, foi completamente renovado, tanto nas instalações eléctricas quanto hidráulicas e interiormente, e distribui-se por dois pisos. No piso térreo, área social com sala de estar, jantar e cozinha em open space totalmente equipada, com grande janela de sacada, com acesso a varanda e que permite a entrada de bastante luz natural para todo o espaço, e casa de banho social. No piso inferior, suite, que comunica com amplo terraço e permite o contacto direto com a natureza envolvente. \n\nO condomínio Victory Village oferece comodidades adicionais, incluindo estacionamento para os moradores, piscina, bar e campos de ténis para os amantes deste desporto. Além disso, o condomínio permite acesso direto à conhecida praia do Gigi.\n\nLocalizado a 14 minutos walking distance da praia do Gigi, dos principais campos de golfe e de Vale do Lobo, onde pode encontrar, comércio, serviços, restaurantes e bares. A 4 minutos driving distance do centro comercial Quinta Shopping, a 20 minutos do aeroporto de Faro, e ainda a 2h30 do aeroporto de Lisboa. \n\nCategoria Energética: D\n\nRenovated 1-bedroom duplex apartment with 95 sqm of gross private area, located in the prestigious Victory Village condominium, with private parking, pool, and garden, in Quinta do Lago, Algarve.\n\nThe apartment, which is sold fully furnished and equipped, has been completely renovated, including electrical and plumbing installations, and is distributed over two floors. On the ground floor, there's a social area with an open-plan living room, dining area, and fully equipped kitchen, featuring a large bay window with access to a balcony that allows plenty of natural light throughout the space, and a guest bathroom. On the lower floor, there's a suite that connects to a spacious terrace, allowing direct contact with the surrounding nature.\n\nThe Victory Village condominium offers additional amenities, including resident parking, a swimming pool, bar, and tennis courts for sports enthusiasts. Moreover, the condominium provides direct access to the well-known Gigi Beach.\n\nLocated a 14-minute walk from Gigi Beach, the main golf courses, and Vale do Lobo, where you can find shops, services, restaurants, and bars. It's a 4-minute drive from Quinta Shopping mall, 20 minutes from Faro airport, and 2.5 hours from Lisbon airport. \n\nEnergy Rating: D",
